    "Description": "The gcc packages provide compilers for C, C++, Java, Fortran, Objective C, and Ada 95 GNU, as well as related support libraries.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* gcc-toolset-15-gcc: gcc: gcc-toolset-16: gcc: Denial of Service via use-after-free in binary heap erase_if (CVE-2026-102010)\n\n* gcc: libstdc++ integer overflow in `new` operator (CVE-2026-95619)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
